  "title": "MCMWTC - Medic Evacuation Hoist",
  "description": "U.S. Marines with India and Kilo Company, Third Battalion, Third Marine Regiment (3/3), participate in medical evacuation hoist drills at Marine Corps Mountain Warfare Training Center, Bridgeport, California, on October 08, 2012. As part of the larger Mountain Ex 12.7 training, these drills were designed to prepare the Marines of 3/3 for situations that can arise in a wide variety of high altitude environments. (U.S. Marine Corps video by Lance Corporal Jeffrey Scarmazzi / Released)",
